4
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:29,980
Committee Secretary: the Privatization and Management Office, and the Philippine Tax Academy. We would like to acknowledge our resource persons from DOF. We have Secretary Frederick Go together with Undersecretary Maria Edita Tan, Undersecretary Bayani Agabin, Undersecretary NiÃ±o Raymond Alvina, Undersecretary Carlo Fermin Adriano, Undersecretary Catherine Fong, Undersecretary Maria Angela Ignacio, Undersecretary Rolando Ligon Jr., and Undersecretary Joven Balbosa.

5
